WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.540 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Metric rules describe how raw leaf
inputs become calculated results.

2
00:00:04.849 --> 00:00:08.720 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
We will add a separate preparation-effort
measure to this FireSat example.

3
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.760 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
These values are illustrations
for learning the tool;

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.300 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
an operational assessment needs
estimates supported by evidence

5
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.920 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and explicit assumptions.

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.100 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Open Metric rules and choose Add metric.

7
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:24.940 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Set the identifier to PreparationHours,
the label to Preparation effort,

8
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.780 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and the unit to hours.

9
00:00:27.115 --> 00:00:31.860 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Set AND to SUM, OR to MIN, and SAND to SUM.

10
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.400 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
These rules combine required
preparation and select the least

11
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.120 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
preparation among alternatives.

12
00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:41.080 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Leave the default blank, so an
unassessed leaf remains unknown,

13
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.960 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and choose Stage rules.

14
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.520 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Preparation effort is its own quantity.

15
00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.740 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
We are not automatically adding it to
AttackTime or claiming that it equals

16
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.600 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
total elapsed attack duration.

17
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:55.200 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Its scope must stay consistent
wherever we enter it.

18
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.900 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Select Abuse counter rollover and
enter four for the new leaf metric,

19
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.960 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
then choose Stage leaf values.

20
00:01:02.222 --> 00:01:06.680 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Select the existing Steal the report
signing key attack, enter two,

21
00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:07.900 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and stage that value.

22
00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.420 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Parent and root results are recalculated;

23
00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.600 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
we do not type independent
totals into their cards.

24
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.760 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Now review the AttackCost threshold,
set to ABOVE five thousand.

25
00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:22.500 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
A calculated cost of exactly five
thousand fails this strict test;

26
00:01:22.538 --> 00:01:24.360 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
equality is not above.

27
00:01:24.652 --> 00:01:27.580 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Read the result with its
units and analysis status.

28
00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.200 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Higher required attacker effort
indicates stronger resistance,

29
00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.580 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
while unknown values remain
unresolved inputs rather

30
00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:35.720 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
than assumed protection.

31
00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.760 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
At the upper right of the canvas,
select Nocturne for dark mode,

32
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.360 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
then Parchment to return.

33
00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.480 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
This changes presentation only.
